#   lan_updates: host names in a rule kept to zones: their addresses are not known
#   gre_tunnel: schedule 'office_hours' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times; schedule office_hours is not converted; an ICMP type, or a protocol other than TCP, UDP, ICMP and ICMPv6: the MX has no field for it
